    if: c.fputs("end: prototype\n\n# Backend method symbols are l2_m{i}; intern and find_method keep source names. c.malloc stays the foreign door.\n# Publication: write tmp; if dest.bak exists pick dest.bak.N; rename dest to that bak; rename tmp to dest; on fail restore bak or report its path. Not atomic. No recursive FS. Foreign bak is not deleted.\n# OwnUsed char/int/size_t/unsigned fields are children of the callable Structure M itself, the reserved argument; the node of M is only its lexical parent. Char cache is typed char; graph data is all_chars cell. Numeric caches keep their declared C type; graph data uses a distinct owned LMX_TYPE_INT, LMX_TYPE_SIZE_T or LMX_TYPE_UNSIGNED cell mutated in place (no interned shared size_t, no int narrowing). Dirty-only checkpoint after actuals, immediately before the executed call, and before return. Explicit node\\name writes the graph, not the cache.\n# LmP0Text is the existing C ABI from l1src/p0.lm1.h (data, length), a limited migration adapter, not a general C header parser and not a silent layout for new L2 Structures. LmP0TrailerRole is that same header's typedef int (NONE/DASH_CUTTER/END/RETURN/UNTIL), not intern16. Lmx structural access stays child-index. Foreign C is spelled c.name and emitted as written; the C compiler checks it. A bare name is an L2 call resolved against unit methods and parsed prototype: declarations. Body @: LmP0Text is an 11.2.1 address slot l2_s, not OwnUsed and not lmx_own. Pointer results @: char / @: LmP0Text; sub: is void. return: slot is the pointer value, not @slot. @: size_t is a typed out-param; name[0]: stores through it (literal 0 only). L2 @ actuals are not emitted; a type-9 actual is the pointer value forwarded. Checkpoint even if OwnUsed is empty. Same-name char/size_t argument and own field share the parameter from the own-decl line; dirty-only publish is to this method's own Structure M, not to the node of M and not to the caller. An argument without that bind is never published. Executable if/else/while/for bodies are graph Structures; body own fields publish into their exact host. L2ImmutQuery is a borrowed immutable-query adapter (not LmP0Text); fill is a temporary L1 helper behind the L2 make method. text_equals is the mutable fallback (strlen+memcmp). equals_query hashes current text bytes against a prepared query hash. &&/|| with calls use guarded if/temps; skipped RHS does not prep nested actuals. Pure &&/|| stay L1 C expressions.\n\n", l2_out) < 0
        c.fclose(l2_out)
